Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:01.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.99,0:00:04.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Do I look terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:09.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh! You're so adorable, it's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:11.11,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,It looks perfect on you, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:18.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm gonna wear it tomorrow \Nat the Face Reveal Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:21.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I am the demon king's daughter, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Fear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.38,Default,AHRIMAN/DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Eek! How spooky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:27.22,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.76,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I wanted Lady Doux to have an outfit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.21,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,that'd make her look \Nterrifying and dignified...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.77,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Vouche!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:34.77,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,IN CHARGE OF THE OUTFIT\NVOUCHE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:12.48,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Face Reveal Ceremony Is Too Lively!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:12.48,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE FACE REVEAL CEREMONY IS TOO LIVELY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:16.12,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:18.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Do I look okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.36,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,All that happens at a Face Reveal Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:23.11,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,is literally her showing her \Nface and greeting the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's not that simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:27.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Face Reveal Ceremony determines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:32.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,if the next demon king is truly worthy \Nof their position and our service!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's what's determined there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.69,0:02:35.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And if they aren't, some \Nhave even plotted mutinies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and assassinations!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux doesn't even know \Nhow to be a proper demon yet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:42.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,so what do you think will happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:45.52,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Yeah, but she's not going \Nto learn that by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.22,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Just give up and deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, there's still a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:52.31,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:57.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is the speech manuscript I spent \Nall night writing for Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.49,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:01.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If I let Lady Doux handle \Nher own speech, it'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:05.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,When Doux grows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:07.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Doux wants to go on field \Ntrips with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,make a pool made of sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,lay in the sun with Papa,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,have sports festivals, and sing songs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's how that'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:21.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She wouldn't utter a single word \Nbefitting of the next demon king!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:24.51,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,You stayed up all night,\N and it messed with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:29.95,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,In order to make sure tomorrow's ceremony \Ndoesn't fail, I need to get this to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:32.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:34.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:37.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I must talk to you about \Ntomorrow's ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.58,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux seems more serious than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.60,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:48.45,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is... could it be \Na speech manuscript?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:51.09,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I had no idea she was writing one herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:55.25,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'll just have to take it and \Nswap it out with the one I wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:04:01.06,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But she's working so hard on writing \Nit, so I shouldn't take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:02.67,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:05.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:07.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:08.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:14.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Um... Y-You look so serious writing \Nthat, so I was just curious...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:19.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is writing all the stuff she's \Ngonna say at the recital tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:26.07,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's not a recital! And now it's becoming \Neven more difficult to swap out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:27.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:32.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A diary about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:32.72,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,BIG SISTER JAHI DIARY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:39.15,italics,DOUX,0,0,0,,We did a stealing trial today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:39.48,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,WE DID A STEALING TRIAL TODAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.50,italics,DOUX,0,0,0,,I brought him mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:43.24,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,I BROUGHT HIM MUSHROOMS!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:48.24,italics,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister taught me \Nmagic, and we played lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:48.24,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,BIG SISTER TAUGHT ME MAGIC AND WE PLAYED LOTS!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:50.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I'm terribly sorry, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I read that without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:56.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:05:01.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've been writing in that diary \Never since I met you, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:02.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:05.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've been writing in it so I
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:10.91,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,don't forget all the things you \Ntaught me and can learn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:17.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I can draw magic circles \Nwithout looking now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I kept working real hard, \Nand now I learned how!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:25.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll do my best tomorrow, \Nso just watch me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:26.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:47.46,Default,EXECUTIVE DEMON,0,0,0,,We will now start the \NFace Reveal Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:52.84,Default,EXECUTIVE DEMON,0,0,0,,Wait patiently to see and hear the words \Nof Lady Doux, our next demon king!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:09.57,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's finally time, Dahaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.65,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,It is, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:14.51,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Oh, just look how magnificent she looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.76,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's finally begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:19.99,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What? You're still worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:22.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm the most anxious right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:25.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And I never got to give \Nher the manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:27.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:32.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All that's left is for me to \Nbelieve and watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:42.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I am the demon king's daughter, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.79,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:53.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Uh... Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:07.31,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:11.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's definitely a greeting \Nonly Doux could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:12.64,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.70,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:20.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"Doux's Dream."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:27.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"When Doux grows up, Doux \Nwants to conquer the world!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:33.09,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,D-Did Lady Doux actually just \Nsay "conquer the world"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:36.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"Because Papa told me that \Nconquering the world is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:40.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and we'll make everyone \Nin the world friends!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:41.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:49.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"But I need to become a full-fledged \Ndemon to do that, so Doux is studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:53.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And so I'm gonna show everyone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:54.35,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.47,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Please make some space.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:57.32,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Please make some space!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:02.29,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux, we're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.08,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That spell is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:29.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:33.95,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TREE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:31.93,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:37.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The spell I taught her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:40.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:42.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Do you remember, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:47.53,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The first time you and Doux met...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:51.42,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,When Doux could barely even walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:59.66,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're doing amazing, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.83,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,So this is Your Majesty's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:07.82,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm, looks like you will also suffice \Nas the next demon king's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:10.22,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?! B-But that's so sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.23,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What's the problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:16.32,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You've gotten used to being \Nmy attendant, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:20.95,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I want you to support \NDoux as she grows, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.95,0:09:22.68,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Support her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.59,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:26.92,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,At some point, I was \Nconcentrating so much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.37,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,on teaching \Nthat I had forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:30.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.47,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:34.71,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux is growing at her \Nown pace, as she should.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:39.72,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And that my other duty is to \Nsupport her growth by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:45.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,She taught me lots of things I \Ncouldn't do. So I learned them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and now I can do lots of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:54.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And when Doux conquers the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:10:00.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is going to teach everyone around \Nthe world things they can't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:06.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is gonna conquer the world \Nto help everyone who's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:07.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:11.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You pulled that off brilliantly, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.21,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:14.40,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She ruined everything with that last part!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:17.96,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You can only conquer the world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:21.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,by taking from others, oppressing \Nthem, and ruling over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And yet Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:25.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Don't be such a spoilsport.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:30.31,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Just look at that crowd \Nand how excited they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:34.31,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Everyone is admiring how brave Doux looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.31,0:10:36.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,She couldn't possibly \Nbe any more successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.66,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,You need to be more honest with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:45.27,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,You just praised her a moment ago, \Nsaying, "That's wonderful, Lady Doux."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:45.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.28,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And while you were beaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I take back what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please don't get a big head over this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Just because you grew a {\i1}tiny{\i0} bit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,doesn't change the fact that \NI have many things
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:00.96,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I need to teach you still!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:02.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:06.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I hope you'll continue to \Nbe prepared, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:21.95,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The demon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:27.56,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,A chaotic world where all demons \Ncarry out all their evil deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:33.48,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,With his great power, the demon king \Nset out to conquer all worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.19,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:38.23,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The demon king suddenly \Nstopped his conquest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:41.65,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,letting a fleeting moment of \Npeace to come to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:44.78,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,And the reason behind this decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:46.96,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,There are only a few who \Nknow that the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.59,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,lies within the demon king's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:51.38,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The heir to the demon king...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:53.42,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Her name is Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:59.51,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,So what about Doux made the evil demon \Nking stop his plans to conquer the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:00.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:03.47,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:09.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! Welcome home, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:11.76,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Were you a naughty little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:18.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll help you carry your stuff, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:24.17,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Y-You're such a sweet child that \Ncares so much for your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:29.03,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The reason he stopped his conquest is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:33.91,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The Future Demon King Is Too Kind!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:33.91,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE FUTURE DEMON KING IS TOO KIND!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.77,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:38.40,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Are you already done \Nwith work for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.40,0:12:40.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, he is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:43.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He said he wanted to play with Lady \NDoux and ran out of the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.29,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:48.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So, Dahaka, what did you \Nand Doux play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:54.29,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Well, we actually weren't playing. \NDoux said she wanted to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:55.62,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Study?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanted to study spwells!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.72,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you tired of your toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:02.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:06.32,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, I promised everyone at my recital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:10.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I want to be a great demon \Nking like you, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:12.13,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:15.53,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're not only kind,\Nbut you've grown so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:18.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm learning real hard! Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:26.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ubaaborunikka Tajaruuya Koyanyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:29.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This incantation! It's a \Nlanguage conversion spell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:32.66,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is she trying to learn \Nsuch a high-level spell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:37.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Rumu...ri... Rumu...to ...ta...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:40.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is where I always get stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux! You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.80,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You were able to recite a \Nlong incantation this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:47.63,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Yes! That's already amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.47,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:52.54,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ever since the Face Reveal \NCeremony ended in a huge success,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:56.81,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty and Lady Dahaka are \Nbabying Lady Doux even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.20,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi, I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?! A-About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:04.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Since Doux has made significant progress \Nin becoming the next demon king,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:08.11,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,her trial today will be to experience \Nthe demon king's duties!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Duties!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:17.93,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Hmph. I'll acknowledge the guts you had \Nto sneak into the demon castle as spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.84,Default,GARDEN DEMON SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.17,Default,GARDEN DEMON SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,You rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.66,Default,GARDEN DEMON SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:27.69,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please \Npunish these criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Harrumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:38.99,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Hey! What's Lady Doux doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty apparently wanted her\Nto experience his duties
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,to help her become the next demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:44.50,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:48.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,As she said, my daughter Doux \Nwill be punishing you all today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:49.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.63,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:52.94,Default,ENEMY DEMON A,0,0,0,,Tch! Who do you think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:55.53,Default,ENEMY DEMON B,0,0,0,,What could a little brat like her do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:57.34,Default,ENEMY DEMON C,0,0,0,,We'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:07.87,Default,ENEMY DEMONS,0,0,0,,This feels so comfy and nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:09.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sleepy bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Sh-She put them to bed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:15.88,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be a \Nspell called Dark Spores
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:18.87,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,which rots away anything it touches but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:26.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, all of the prisoners are always \Nsleeping on top of really hard rocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:29.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,so I learned a spell to \Nmake really fluffy futons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:30.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is quite a brilliant spell itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:39.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I need you to at least try \Nto scold her, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.55,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,STRATEGY MEETING
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.67,Default,SAURVA,0,0,0,,I won't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:49.19,Default,SAURVA,0,0,0,,I had handled the southern expedition \Nfield mission up until now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:53.06,Default,DURZUYA,0,0,0,,Well, I was put in charge of \Nit because you're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:55.57,Default,INDRA,0,0,0,,The weaker they are, the louder they cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:58.18,Default,SAURVA,0,0,0,,What?! Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:00.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:05.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,When it gets this bad, the only \Nway to shut them up is with force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:08.46,Default,SAURVA,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Step outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:12.23,Default,DURZUYA,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:19.45,Default,THREE,0,0,0,,What a gentle flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.22,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,They calmed down somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:23.58,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You work so hard, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:25.34,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Thank you, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.97,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,It's very delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:27.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:32.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Okay, let us continue the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:36.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Regarding the various supplies needed \Non these expedition field missions...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:39.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is there anything else that you need \Nother than what's already been discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:40.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:44.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Uh, well, if you \Nwould then, Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:46.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,How many snacks can they take with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.89,0:16:48.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They can't bring any!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:52.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But if they're going on field trips, \Nit'd be more fun to bring snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:54.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They're not field trips! They're \Nexpedition field missions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.06,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Why don't we just make them field trips?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.75,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:16:59.53,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:06.26,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:11.85,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux's kindness makes everyone \Nelse around her kind and easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:08.89,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:15.27,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And it's unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:17.28,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,There's trouble, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:23.64,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,This is the ends of the demon \Nworld, the Jet Black Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:24.77,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,JET BLACK FOREST
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The child of... a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.86,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.70,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,He can't understand our words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:37.50,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,so even when we try to move \Nhim, he just won't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:41.13,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The giants are great warriors, \Nmembers of an ancient civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:44.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and are known for their \Nunparalleled strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:46.55,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:49.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But the bigger problem \Nhere is not their strength
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:51.18,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but the fact that he \Ndoesn't understand us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:56.42,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My language conversion spell doesn't \Nwork on the giants' language.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:58.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then maybe if we use a \Nlittle bit of force...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:10.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The giant quieted down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:15.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! I'll try that talky spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:21.58,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Er, Doux. That spell \Ndoesn't work on giants...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.21,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Very well. Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:38.27,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let's believe in Doux's growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:50.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ubaabarunikka Tajaruiya Koyanru...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:55.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Rumuri... Rumuto... Iru... Iru...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:56.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:57.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Irupapitto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:08.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:12.94,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, the spell is weak, but the \Nrange is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:14.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This should...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess it didn't work after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:19.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, what are you....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:28.91,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Mr. Lady Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:33.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er... Lady Doux! Now's not \Nthe time for catching bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.29,Default,LADY BUG,0,0,0,,That child is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:38.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And the bug spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:43.16,Default,LADY BUG,0,0,0,,This child was separated from the \Ngiants and got lost in the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.39,Default,LADY BUG,0,0,0,,while the giants were moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:48.55,Default,LADY BUG,0,0,0,,I know because I was stuck on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:51.14,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:54.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, if the spell doesn't work on giants,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:58.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I thought I'd have everyone \Naround here help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:01.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If he's lost, let's all \Nlook for his parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.55,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:05.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, who exactly is "everyone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:07.82,Default,TREE,0,0,0,,That giant came from the northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:13.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-N-Now a tree's talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:14.68,Default,MUSHROOM,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:15.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And even the mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:18.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Perhaps Doux's kindness and \Nthe fact that she knows
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.46,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,she's going to be the next \Ndemon king made this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is truly a method befitting Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Befitting Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:37.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Mr. Lady Bug! Mr. Tree! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:38.81,Default,LADY BUG,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.38,Default,TREE,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:43.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mr. Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:53.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We're all together, so it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:57.75,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:05.25,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We made new friends again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:06.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.74,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty is staying behind \Nat their settlement
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:11.61,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,to work out an alliance with the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:19.02,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Lady Doux's kindness will \Ncontinue to affect those around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:21.57,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons do not need kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:24.67,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I \Nthought until recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:29.09,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But now, there's a small part of \Nme that wants to see just how much
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:32.65,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux's kindness can change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:36.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Did you have fun again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:38.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Today was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:40.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:48.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi! Let's do another \Ntrial together tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:54.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I am your attendant, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:22:00.71,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"LET'S READ THE PICTURE BOOK"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: NAOKI YANAGISAWA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.73,0:22:08.32,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Teach me, teach me even more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:11.32,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Cruel and inhumane things!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:12.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Cruel and inhumane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.43,0:22:15.83,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,These trials are super duper fun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:19.46,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Doux can, Doux can do them all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.34,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Steal all the mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:24.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Must shrewdly oppress!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:26.84,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's play and share everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:28.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No sharing allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:38.77,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's take someone we don't know\NAnd become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:46.88,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,You just know\NSo many things
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.19,0:22:54.70,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Please teach me, please teach me\NBig Sister Jahi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:58.91,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:12.38,Default,HAURVATAT,0,0,0,,O Great Benevolent God, \NLord Ahura Mazda...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:14.72,Default,HAURVATAT,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:18.10,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,The kindness and innocence \Nthat child possesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:22.70,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,I fear the future where the \Ndemons use it for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:26.67,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,She should not be in the demon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:31.46,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,Bring her to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:33.11,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,This child...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.11,0:23:36.19,Default,AHURA MAZDA,0,0,0,,The daughter of the demon king, Doux.
